\newlabel{fig:evolution}{{1}{3}{Repository evolution as a research program rather than a single monolithic model. Early signal extraction work (Phase A/B/C) feeds the quantitative branches; Gemini V1--V5 introduces debiased multi-persona forecasting; \texttt {latest/} acts as a modular bridge; \texttt {final phase} formalizes market memory and walk-forward ablations; TEPC extends the program into dynamic topology and chaos-aware forecasting}{figure.caption.1}{}}
